GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/999/products
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Opening hours of a supplier (US-10): expect 200 with the week from Monday to Sunday; no token needed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/opening-hours
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Replace the own opening hours (US-10, TC-10): expect 200 with the stored week; a day not listed is closed
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/opening-hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

[
  {"day": "MONDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00"},
  {"day": "TUESDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00"},
  {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00"},
  {"day": "THURSDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00"},
  {"day": "FRIDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00"},
  {"day": "SATURDAY", "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "18:00"}
]

### F1 - Opening hours closing before opening: expect 422, field closesAt
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/opening-hours
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

[{"day": "MONDAY", "opensAt": "21:00", "closesAt": "08:00"}]

